damping." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 213.36 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4eb3c970-ccb8-5789-8bdc-c62be60e0551")) (text "SD_MODE is rated to VDD + 0.3 V: 2.2k limits it to ~1.2 mA with the branch off (datasheet remedy). No power-good path (D-067 C)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 213.36 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "27871217-883f-5877-9015-6a50c172497b")) (text "Unfitted 5V-present divider (5.0 V -> 3.0 V) on J5-1 pin 10, for a later CA-06 change (D-067 C)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 213.36 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ddde8bbc-4e64-5cfb-8699-4372a44c2e91")) (text "H1-H3: M2 SMT spacers (8 mm) reflowed on the top face over plated Ø3 holes (D-067 I1), no net. Board-local (3.5, 30.0), (3.5, 8.0), (18.0, 19.0) (D-067 E)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "87b5539f-92dc-541d-bd44-53e2c9759c86")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
